                            <h3>Paul A. Geary. Jr.</h3>
                            <h4>Co-Founder, Executive Chairman</h4>
                            <p>
                                Paul A. Geary, Jr. co-founded GWR Medical in 1996, the leading national provider and supplier of Topical Oxygen Therapy to treat hard to heal open wounds and burns.  Mr. Geary has spent his 40-year career in executive management of scientific research and development, marketing, sales and distribution of chemical, pharmaceutical, and health devices, therapies and products.  Mr. Geary began his career in 1965 with McKesson and Robbin as a sales manager in Philadelphia then served as Vice President of Sales and Marketing of East Falls Chemical Corporation in 1969. 
                                Paul has lead GWR's 20-year commitment to independent research for topical oxygen therapy with leading researchers and institutions.  The scientific discoveries from this research have helped to substantiate the efficacy of topical oxygen by the regulatory, medical and payer communities. 
                                Paul is a 1965 graduate of the University of Notre Dame with a BA Degree spanning Business, Chemistry and Liberal Arts.  

                            </p>
